DESCRIPTION:BEKSCITY RUN CLUB — Social Day\nCategory: Monthly Signature Event\nDistrict: ALL DISTRICTS\nMeeting Point: Fruit Oasis\nDistance: 5 km\nRoute Stops: Scenic parkway route to Fruit Oasis\n\nPLANNED ACTIVITIES:\nEasy recovery 5k jog\, fresh fruit breakfast\, healthy lifestyle talk\, and community games.\n\nABOUT THIS RUN:\nMonthly social day celebrating runners' monthly achievements at Fruit Oasis. Easy recovery jog followed by healthy smoothies\, fruit platters\, music\, and social bonding.\n\nSTANDARD SCHEDULE:\n• 06:45 AM — Check-in and gathering\n• 07:00 AM — Warm-up session\n• 07:15 AM — Group run departs\n• 08:15 AM — Cooldown & stretching\n• 08:30 AM — Refreshments & community social\n\nBEKSCITY RUN CLUB | Keep Moving Forward
